---
---
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>PANAMERA MEDIA CO</title>
<style>
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
  body{font-family:-apple-system,Inter,Helvetica;background:#fff;color:#0a0a0a}
  .breaking{background:#0a0a0a;color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:8px 16px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase}
  .breaking span{color:#FF2E93}
  header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;background:#fff;border-bottom:1.5px solid #0a0a0a}
  .topbar{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px 24px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
  .logo{font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1.5px;font-size:20px}
  .container{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
  .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 0.7fr;gap:20px;padding:28px 0}
  .video{border:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;border-radius:16px;aspect-ratio:16/9;background:#0a0a0a;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;text-decoration:none}
  .video-inner{text-align:center}
  .video-inner div{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;opacity:0.5;margin-bottom:8px}
  .video-inner h3{font-size:18px;font-weight:900}
  .hero-text{border:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;border-radius:16px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
  .eyebrow{font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:0.5;margin-bottom:12px}
  .hero-text h1{font-size:48px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-2px;line-height:0.9}
  .hero-text h1 .pink{color:#FF2E93} .hero-text h1 .blue{color:#38B6FF} .hero-text h1 .yellow{color:#FFD60A}
  .hero-text p{margin-top:14px;font-size:14px;opacity:0.6;line-height:1.5}
  .btns{margin-top:20px;display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .btn{padding:13px 20px;border-radius:100px;font-weight:800;font-size:12px;text-decoration:none;border:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;display:inline-flex}
  .btn-black{background:#0a0a0a;color:#fff} .btn-white{background:#fff;color:#0a0a0a}
  .cards{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
  .card{border:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;border-radius:14px;padding:16px;background:#fff}
  .card h4{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.2px;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:0.5;margin-bottom:8px}
  .card a{font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;color:#0a0a0a;font-size:13px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
  .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}
  .story{border:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;color:#0a0a0a;background:#fff}
  .thumb{aspect-ratio:16/9;background:#0a0a0a;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:900;font-size:12px}
  .body{padding:14px} .body h4{font-size:14px;font-weight:800} .body p{font-size:12px;opacity:0.5;margin-top:4px}
  .section{padding:32px 0;border-top:1.5px solid #0a0a0a} .section h2{font-size:26px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1px;margin-bottom:18px} .pink{color:#FF2E93} .blue{color:#38B6FF} .yellow{color:#FFD60A}
  footer{border-top:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;padding:24px;text-align:center;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;opacity:0.5}
  @media(max-width:900px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero-text h1{font-size:36px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="breaking">PANAMERA MEDIA CO — SESIONES EN VIVO</div>
<header><div class="topbar"><div class="logo">PANAMERA MEDIA CO</div><div style="font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;opacity:0.5">PANAMERAMEDIA.COM</div></div></header>

<div class="container">
  <div class="hero">
    <a class="video" href="https://www.youtube.com/@panameramedia" target="_blank">
      <div class="video-inner">
        <div>LATEST ON YOUTUBE</div>
        <h3>▶ VER SESIONES</h3>
      </div>
    </a>
    <div class="hero-text">
      <div class="eyebrow">Panamera Sesiones</div>
      <h1><span class="pink">PANAMERA</span> <span class="blue">SESIONES</span> <span class="yellow">EN VIVO</span></h1>
      <p>Entrevistas y sesiones que celebran lo que somos.</p>
      <div class="btns">
        <a class="btn btn-black" href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/panamera-sesiones/id6790205633" target="_blank">Apple Podcasts</a>
        <a class="btn btn-white" href="https://www.youtube.com/@panameramedia" target="_blank">YouTube</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:32px">
    <div class="card"><h4>Escucha</h4><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/panamera-sesiones/id6790205633" target="_blank">Apple Podcasts <span>→</span></a></div>
    <div class="card"><h4>Mira</h4><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@panameramedia" target="_blank">YouTube @panameramedia <span>→</span></a></div>
    <div class="card"><h4>Sigue</h4><a href="https://www.instagram.com/panameramediaco/" target="_blank">@panameramediaco <span>→</span></a></div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2><span class="pink">Últimas</span> <span class="blue">Sesiones</span></h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <a class="story" href="https://www.youtube.com/@panameramedia" target="_blank"><div class="thumb">▶ PLAY</div><div class="body"><h4>Sesión En Vivo</h4><p>Nuevas entrevistas cada semana</p></div></a>
      <a class="story" href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/panamera-sesiones/id6790205633" target="_blank"><div class="thumb">🎙 AUDIO</div><div class="body"><h4>Podcast Oficial</h4><p>Apple Podcasts</p></div></a>
      <a class="story" href="https://www.instagram.com/panameramediaco/" target="_blank"><div class="thumb">📸 IG</div><div class="body"><h4>Detrás de Cámaras</h4><p>Contenido diario</p></div></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<footer>PANAMERA MEDIA CO © 2026</footer>
</body>
</html>
